        6,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_El_Nogal_Club_bombing"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The 2003 explosion detonated 200 kg of explosives in a third‑floor garage, killing 36 of the 600 people inside.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_El_Nogal_Club_bombing"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Colombian Vice President Francisco Santos Calderón blamed FARC for the attack, saying there was no doubt of their involvement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_El_Nogal_Club_bombing"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The United Nations condemned the bombing with Security Council Resolution 1465 on 13 February 2003.",
